silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_03_cheese_face_and_siblings_sections_02_sibling_connections_concrete_anchor_3_DomesticCat#domesticcat silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCat is the domestic-cat refinement class; a:Mittens->DomesticCat under r:DomesticCat->Cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomesticCat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
